fix(geo261): accept canonical assembly source records

The neutral-source entry now admits owned and assembly records emitted by the existing bridge dump. The scene parser and candidate validation still validate their full grammar, while the legacy snapshot entry keeps its original admission list. Existing three assembly graph product cases reproduce this rejection and must pass without removing their source/edge checks. Test counts unchanged; native verification pending.
